of an overview of what

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.600
we will be reviewing today
or looking at-- we'll

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.080
quickly go over some of
the technical benefits

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.640
of Cloud Dataflow.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.830
This is a level 300 session.

