00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:03.330
I'll do a demo of auto
scaling and show you

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.680
the history of autoscaling
for a particular pipeline

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.120
that I will launch.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.940
I'll call Ankur to
and here is going

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:13.120
to talk about how
Brightcove is using

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:17.010
Cloud Dataflow and
